  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Counterspell, Dispelling Attack</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you strike a target with a weapon attack made as part of an attack action, you may use Dispelling Attack as a free action rather than a swift action. When you use Dispelling Attack in conjunction with the Improved Counterspell or Greater Counterspell feat, you may choose to create an area dispel centered on the target (and including the target) rather than dispelling multiple effects on the target.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 2: Counters and Control</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
